<HowTo id="studio.swaps" />

In a program, list approved swaps under each exercise; they're shown to the client first and always
allowed.

When a client swaps, their phone asks why: **It hurts**, **I don't feel safe**, **Not at my gym** or
**Something else**, with an optional note. You get a message with the exercise filled in ("I swapped
Back squat for Leg press today. It hurts: left knee when I go deep."), whatever your swap rule
allows, so you hear about it either way.

<CanCant ids={["coach-swaps"]} />
